   {
    "title": "Before you ask",
    "column": 1,
    "blocks": [
     {
      "kind": "bullets",
      "items": [
       "**1** Read what it remembers",
       "**2** Fixes → **Instructions**",
       "**3** One-off chat? Memory off",
       "**4** One full message, not five",
       "**5** Ask it to find the old chat",
       "**6** Say if it should search"
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
